  "display_title": "An Unwholesome Proposal",
  "description": "Believing in his fantastic acting skills, Moon Ji-An stuck with Yoon Kang-Jae as his manager through thick and thin. But after eight years of constantly cleaning up after the mess Kang-Jae's picky personality made, Jian thinks it's time to focus on herself and quit her job. As soon as Kang-Jae hears, he cleans up his act, sticks to her like glue, and ponders how to make her stay. He's determined to keep Ji-An by his side, but can he come up with a proposal good enough for her before it's too late \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
